msgid "You made it!"
msgstr "{crew|Du|Du|Ni} klarade det!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You reached {place} before the pirates! The people of {place} chase the pirates away, and give you"
" {silver} silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Du|Du|Ni} kom till {place} före piraterna! Folket {place@in} jagar bort piraterna och ger "
"{crew|dig|dig|er} {silver} silver."

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Caught!"
msgstr "Fångad!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pirates caught you! They laugh, kiss the prow of your boat, and sail away. Try again?"
msgstr ""
"Piraterna fångade {crew|dig|dig|er}! De skrattar, pussar båtens stäv och seglar iväg. Försöka "
"igen?"

