#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/007_the_swan_in_the_net/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A swan is caught in an old net in the reeds by my farm. She can not fly! My shears are blunt. "
"Fetch sharp shears from Hrafn the smith in Gäddarby, quick."
msgstr ""
"En svan har fastnat i ett gammalt nät i vassen vid min gård. Hon kan inte flyga! Min sax är slö. "
"Hämta en vass sax hos smeden Hrafn i Gäddarby, fort."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/007_the_swan_in_the_net/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "For a swan? Take my best shears, and bring them back some day."
msgstr "Till en svan? Ta min bästa sax, och lämna tillbaka den någon gång."

