msgstr "Ett lamm med ett svart öra? Vi såg ett på Laxön, det åt av Tovas blommor!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She swam over! Can you imagine? She is wet but well. Take her home."
msgstr ""
"Hon simmade över! Kan {crew|du|du|ni} tänka {crew|dig|dig|er}? Hon är blöt men mår bra. Ta hem "
"henne."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Black Ear! She runs to her mother. Keep the other lamb of that ewe: she likes you."
msgstr ""
"Svartöra! Hon springer till sin mamma. Behåll tackans andra lamm: det tycker om {crew|dig|dig|er}."

