#. the thing '{count|a bundle of herbs|{count} bundles of herbs}' for {thing@acc} in the
#. translations: the accusative (the direct object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty
#. if it is the same as the plain translation
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
