msgstr "{count|en gås|{count} gäss}"

#. the thing '{count|a goose|{count} geese}' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative
#. (the direct object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the
#. plain translation
#: data/missions/048_geese_for_the_market/mission.json
