msgstr "Hilds bröllop"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My daughter Hild marries Leif the shepherd! I can forge a sword, but a wedding? Bring four casks "
"of mead from Dimmberga and two crates of cloth for her dress."
msgstr ""
"Min dotter Hild ska gifta sig med herden Leif! Jag kan smida ett svärd, men ett bröllop? Hämta "
"fyra fat mjöd från Dimmberga och två lådor tyg till hennes klänning."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the cloth."
msgstr "Mjöd! Nu tyget."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My sweetest mead, for Hild. Tell her to be happy!"
msgstr "Mitt sötaste mjöd, till Hild. Säg åt henne att vara lycklig!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/060_hilds_wedding/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Blue cloth for my dress! Father cries, he says it is the smoke. Come to the wedding!"
msgstr "Blått tyg till min klänning! Far gråter, han säger att det är röken. Kom på bröllopet!"

#. who speaks in a task
