#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My horse Grane will not eat, and he is sad. Bring Tova to look at him, and take her home after."
msgstr ""
"Min häst Grane vill inte äta, och han är ledsen. Hämta Tova så att hon får titta på honom, och ta "
"hem henne efteråt."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tova: Just as I thought: a sore tooth. I file it smooth... There. Let him rest a night."
msgstr ""
"Tova: Precis som jag trodde: en tand som gör ont. Jag filar den slät... Så. Låt honom vila en "
"natt."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not eating? Let me see his teeth."
msgstr "Äter han inte? Låt mig titta på hans tänder."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Back on my island. You were good assistants: soon you heal on your own."
msgstr ""
"Hemma på min ö igen. {crew|Du var en duktig medhjälpare|Du var en duktig medhjälpare|Ni var "
"duktiga medhjälpare}: snart botar {crew|du|du|ni} på egen hand."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Grane eats like a wolf again! Take Tova home, with my thanks."
msgstr "Grane äter som en varg igen! Ta hem Tova, med mitt tack."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/066_the_chieftains_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Horses' teeth grow all their life; sometimes they must be filed smooth."
msgstr "Hästars tänder växer hela livet; ibland måste de filas släta."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
