#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I want a brooch like a dragon! Hrafn makes it, if he gets glass beads for the eyes from the "
"market. And it costs 15 silver: I have saved them."
msgstr ""
"Jag vill ha en brosch som ser ut som en drake! Hrafn gör den, om han får glaspärlor till ögonen "
"från marknaden. Och den kostar 15 silver: dem har jag sparat."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Green eyes for a dragon. Come back tomorrow."
msgstr "Gröna ögon till en drake. Kom tillbaka i morgon."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Green glass beads, from very far away. Small, but precious!"
msgstr "Gröna glaspärlor, från långt, långt bort. Små, men dyrbara!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/067_a_brooch_for_thora/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "It is beautiful! Here, Father gave me 30 silver for you, and two are extra."
