#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Both inns ran dry at the same time! Six barrels for Gudrun in Vargvik and six for Orm in Hallvik. "
"With twelve crates of room, you can do it in one trip!"
msgstr ""
"Båda värdshusen fick slut på öl samtidigt! Sex tunnor till Gudrun i Vargvik och sex till Orm i "
"Hallvik. Med plats för tolv lådor klarar {crew|du|du|ni} det på en tur!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! The guests cheer. Thank you!"
msgstr "Öl! Gästerna jublar. Tack!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At last! I thought I must serve water. Here, silver for you and for Knut."
msgstr ""
"Äntligen! Jag trodde att jag måste servera vatten. Här, silver till {crew|dig|dig|er} och till "
"Knut."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/077_ale_for_two_inns/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everybody drank weak ale every day: it was safer than water from the lake."
msgstr "Alla drack svagt öl varje dag: det var säkrare än vatten från sjön."

