#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Sleepy hens? Lice, I bet. Dust baths with wood ash and a bit of garlic in the water. Here, take "
"garlic."
msgstr ""
"Sömniga hönor? Löss, slår jag vad om. Sandbad med träaska och lite vitlök i vattnet. Här, ta "
"vitlök."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Garlic water, ash baths, fresh grain... Cluck! An egg! You are real healers."
