#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Winter Stores"
msgstr "Vinterförråd"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn again! Before the lakes freeze, fill the store: ten crates of hay and six of grain, within "
"three days. You know how by now!"
msgstr ""
"Höst igen! Innan sjöarna fryser, fyll förrådet: tio lådor hö och sex lådor säd, inom tre dagar. Nu"
" vet {crew|du|du|ni} hur man gör!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for all our animals. Now the grain."
msgstr "Hö till alla våra djur. Nu säden."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full to the roof! Not one animal will be hungry this winter."
msgstr "Förrådet är fullt upp till taket! Inte ett enda djur behöver vara hungrigt i vinter."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn was the busiest time: everything for the long winter had to be in."
msgstr "Hösten var den mest hektiska tiden: allt för den långa vintern måste vara inne."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for Every Farm"
msgstr "Fisk till varje gård"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our best catch ever! Bring three bundles of dried fish to each farm: Frosttorp, Solby and "
"Svanetorp. A gift from Stormvik, for the winter."
msgstr ""
"Vår bästa fångst någonsin! Ta tre knippor torkad fisk till varje gård: Frosttorp, Solby och "
"Svanetorp. En gåva från Stormvik, inför vintern."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "From Tor? What a neighbour!"
msgstr "Från Tor? Vilken granne!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish for the winter! Tell Tor: apples for him in spring."
msgstr "Fisk till vintern! Säg till Tor: äpplen åt honom i vår."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish? For an old man? Tor is a good boy. Thank you!"
msgstr "Fisk? Till en gammal gubbe? Tor är en snäll pojke. Tack!"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fish"
msgstr "Fisk"

