#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/097_fish_for_every_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Neighbours gave each other food before winter; the gift came back another year."
msgstr "Grannar gav varandra mat före vintern; gåvan kom tillbaka ett annat år."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "Inbjudningar"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We hold a feast here on the farm, for all our friends! Invite them: hail three boats on the lakes,"
" and visit Tova and Ragnfrid."
msgstr ""
"Vi har en fest här på gården, för alla våra vänner! Bjud in dem: hälsa på tre båtar på sjöarna, "
"och besök Tova och Ragnfrid."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast? Of course! I will tell everybody on the lakes."
msgstr "En fest? Självklart! Jag berättar för alla på sjöarna."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast at your farm? We come, and bring our fiddle!"
msgstr "En fest på {crew|din|din|er} gård? Vi kommer, och vi tar med fiolen!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Count on me! I bring my best fish."
msgstr "Räkna med mig! Jag tar med min bästa fisk."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "I would not miss it! I come with my herb wine."
msgstr "Det vill jag inte missa! Jag kommer med mitt örtvin."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "We come with all the horses! Silke wants to see her daughter."
msgstr "Vi kommer med alla hästarna! Silke vill träffa sin dotter."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/098_invitations/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A great feast could last a week, with guests from every farm around."
msgstr "En stor fest kunde vara en vecka, med gäster från alla gårdar runt omkring."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Food for the Feast"
msgstr "Mat till festen"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many guests! Bring four crates of mead, four of ale and four of cheese. Twelve crates: your big"
" boat can do it, but you must buy well."
msgstr ""
"Så många gäster! Ta hit fyra lådor mjöd, fyra lådor öl och fyra lådor ost. Tolv lådor: "
"{crew|din|din|er} stora båt klarar det, men {crew|du|du|ni} måste handla klokt."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mead! Now the ale."
msgstr "Mjöd! Nu ölet."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ale! Now the cheese."
msgstr "Öl! Nu osten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Everything is ready: the tables, the torches, the food. Now only the guests!"
msgstr "Allt är klart: borden, facklorna, maten. Nu fattas bara gästerna!"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/099_food_for_the_feast/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "At a feast, the host gave the best food and drink: being generous brought honour."
msgstr "På en fest bjöd värden på den bästa maten och drycken: att vara generös gav heder."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Feast at the Farm"
msgstr "Festen på gården"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The guests come! But some have no boat: bring Old Grim from Svanetorp, Old Halvard from Solby, and"
" Tova from her island. Then the feast begins!"
msgstr ""
"Gästerna kommer! Men några har ingen båt: hämta gamle Grim i Svanetorp, gamle Halvard i Solby och "
"Tova på hennes ö. Sedan börjar festen!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, Grim!"
msgstr "Välkommen, Grim!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A feast for an old man? I bring my cow's best butter!"
msgstr "En fest för en gammal gubbe? Jag tar med det bästa smöret från min ko!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Welcome, Halvard!"
msgstr "Välkommen, Halvard!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "One more trip with my favourite skippers! Did I tell you about the sea serpent?"
msgstr ""
"En tur till med {crew|min favoritskeppare|min favoritskeppare|mina favoritskeppare}! Har jag "
"berättat om sjöormen?"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "My apprentices, healers now, and rowing me to a feast. I am proud of you."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Min lärling|Min lärling|Mina lärlingar}, nu läkare, ror mig till en fest. Jag är stolt över "
"{crew|dig|dig|er}."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/100_the_feast_at_the_farm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Everybody is here: the people and the animals of all the lakes, music and torches and songs. Look "
"what you made of an old boat, three hens and a sheep."
msgstr ""
"Alla är här: människorna och djuren från alla sjöarna, musik och facklor och sånger. Se vad "
"{crew|du|du|ni} har gjort av en gammal båt, tre hönor och ett får."

